## Expected Claude Code Plugins

These plugins are expected to be enabled in your `~/.claude/settings.json`. New devs joining this project should install them to match the team toolchain.

{{PLUGINS_LIST}}

### Custom marketplaces required

{{MARKETPLACES_LIST}}

To enable plugins after install, edit `~/.claude/settings.json`:

```json
{
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "<plugin-name>@<marketplace>": true
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "<marketplace>": {
      "source": { "source": "github", "repo": "<owner>/<repo>" }
    }
  }
}
```

